    <ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock contextRef="c-5" id="f-687">&lt;div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:6pt;text-indent:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;During the quarter ended June 28, 2026, none of our directors or officers (as defined in Rule 16a-1(f) of the Exchange Act) adopted or terminated a &#x201c;Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangement&#x201d; or &#x201c;non-Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangement,&#x201d; as each term is defined in Item 408 of Regulation S-K.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock>
